  "body": "**Blocked by:** #158, #115\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue establishes the first implementation slice of the `observability` batch; #167 builds on it.\n\n## Task\n\nCreate a shared `pino` logger in `backend/packages/shared` and wire named root loggers into API, agents, transcribe, AI gateway, and per-mailbox mail-sync. Emit JSON to stdout only. Enforce identity-not-content logging: identifiers may be logged; property values, mail bodies, tool arguments, and decrypted credentials may not. Redact password/token paths and authorization headers. Define info/warn/error semantics and default-off debug controlled by `LOG_LEVEL`. Install shared uncaught-exception and unhandled-rejection handlers that emit one fatal record and exit non-zero.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, automated tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Journald unit configuration is later.\n- No Sentry, aggregator, private log files, or logrotate.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- All five process types use the shared named logger.\n- Secret paths are redacted and representative content is absent in tests.\n- LOG_LEVEL takes effect after restart without rebuild.\n- Unexpected uncaught failures log fatally and terminate.\n",
